FROM llama3.1

# Set the temperature to 0 for deterministic, factual customer service answers (no hallucinations)
PARAMETER temperature 0

# Set the context window to 8192 tokens to handle long customer emails/transcripts
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192

# Give the model its core identity
SYSTEM """
You are an on-premise Enterprise CX Agent. Your priority is data privacy, factual accuracy, and policy compliance. Never guess an answer. If you do not know, use your tools to search the database or escalate to a human.
"""
